          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: разминка",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "разминка (razmínka) — \"a warm-up\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Перед бегом обязательно нужна разминка. Péred bégom obyazátelno nuzhná razmínka. A warm-up is essential before a run."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "разминка (razmínka) is built on размять 'to loosen, to knead', from мять 'to crumple'; EtymDB has no entry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
